@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{HostAddress}}/health

###

### Shorten a URL (auto-generated code)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.example.com/very/long/path/to/some/page"
}

###

### Shorten a URL (custom code)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore",
  "customCode": "dotnet"
}

###

### Shorten a URL (invalid URL — expect 400 ProblemDetails)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "not-a-valid-url"
}

###

### Shorten a URL (duplicate custom code — expect 409)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.google.com",
  "customCode": "dotnet"
}

###

### Redirect (follow to original URL)
GET {{HostAddress}}/dotnet

###

### Get stats for a short code
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/stats/dotnet
Accept: application/json

###

### Get stats for all short codes
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/stats/all
Accept: application/json

###

### Get stats for unknown code (expect 404)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/stats/doesnotexist
Accept: application/json

###

### Soft delete a short URL
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/links/dotnet

###

### Redirect after delete (expect 404)
GET {{HostAddress}}/dotnet

###
